Usage: cardano-cli dijkstra transaction txid 
                                               ( --tx-body-file FILEPATH
                                               | --tx-file FILEPATH
                                               )
                                               [ --output-json
                                               | --output-text
                                               | --output-yaml
                                               ]
                                               

  Print a transaction identifier.

Available options:
  --tx-body-file FILEPATH  Input filepath of the JSON TxBody. Use `-` to read
                           from standard input.
  --tx-file FILEPATH       Input filepath of the JSON Tx. Use `-` to read from
                           standard input.
  --output-json            Format output to JSON (default).
  --output-text            Format output to TEXT.
  --output-yaml            Format output to YAML.
  -h,--help                Show this help text
